## Tide Island

https://github.com/enhaoswen/Tide-island — Copyright (c) enhaoswen, GPL-3.0.

`shell/modules/island/` is a reimplementation of Tide Island's Dynamic Island
for Caelestia. It contains no code from Tide Island, but it follows that project
closely by design: the state machine, the sizes each state morphs the capsule to,
the corner radii, the hold times, the 400ms OutQuint morph, the type scale, the
cava bar metrics, the three resting pages and the layer set are all Tide's, read
off its source and reimplemented against Caelestia's own services and components.
Colour, typeface and the surface itself are Caelestia's. The C++ backend Tide
ships (`IslandBackend`) has no counterpart here and is not required.

`lyricsmpris`, the lyrics helper Tide ships, is used as an optional external
program if it is installed. It is not vendored here and no code from it is
included.

If you want the original, standalone Dynamic Island, install Tide Island
itself — it is a complete shell in its own right and does considerably more
than this module does.

